/brand.local/
graphify-out/

# Claude Code workspace — hooks, subagents, local rules. Repo is public and this
# is machine-local working config, not product.
/.claude/

# Route snapshots — machine-local evidence for before/after comparisons.
# Deliberately untracked so they SURVIVE a git checkout back to an older tag,
# which is exactly when you need to compare against them.
/snapshots/
/IDENTITY-MIGRATION-SOP.md

# Installed skill packs (npx skills add). Machine-local tooling for how I work,
